sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Op as Operator
  participant CLI as Bootstrap CLI (one-time, local)
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant MB as Meta Business Manager
  participant KV as Key Vault
  participant TM as TokenManager
  participant API as Platform APIs
  rect rgb(238,243,248)
  Note over Op,KV: One-time onboarding (per account)
  Op->>CLI: run auth bootstrap
  CLI->>G: auth code + PKCE, scope youtube.upload + youtube.readonly
  G-->>CLI: refresh_token
  CLI->>KV: set secret yt-refresh-token (never written to disk)
  Op->>MB: create System User, assign IG asset, generate token
  Op->>KV: set secret ig-system-user-token
  end
  rect rgb(255,244,224)
  Note over TM,API: Runtime (every publish)
  TM->>KV: get secret via managed identity
  TM->>G: refresh → access_token (≈1 h)
  TM->>TM: cache in memory until expiry − 5 min
  TM->>API: call with Bearer token
  alt 401 invalid_grant / OAuthException 190
    TM->>TM: mark credential REVOKED in DB
    TM-->>Op: P1 alert: re-run bootstrap
  end
  end
  Note over TM: Daily check: debug_token / tokeninfo, alert 14 days before expiry
